\\\"]\\\"}]\\) gives an axis-aligned elliptical disk with semiaxes lengths \
\\!\\(\\*SubscriptBox[StyleBox[\\\"r\\\", \\\"TI\\\"], StyleBox[\\\"x\\\", \\\
\"TI\\\"]]\\) and \\!\\(\\*SubscriptBox[StyleBox[\\\"r\\\", \\\"TI\\\"], \
