\", \\\"TR\\\"]], \\\",\\\", SubscriptBox[StyleBox[\\\"\[Theta]\\\", \\\"TR\\\
\"], StyleBox[\\\"2\\\", \\\"TR\\\"]]}], \\\"}\\\"}]}], \\\"]\\\"}]\\) gives \
a sector of a disk from angle \
\\!\\(\\*SubscriptBox[StyleBox[\\\"\[Theta]\\\", \\\"TR\\\"], \
StyleBox[\\\"1\\\", \\\"TR\\\"]]\\) to \\!\\(\\*SubscriptBox[StyleBox[\\\"\
\[Theta]\\\", \\\"TR\\\"], StyleBox[\\\"2\\\", \\\"TR\\\"]]\\).\"\>", 
