L, K, \[Psi]r and \[Psi]\[Theta] as functions of Mino time (\[Lambda]) using \
a given by covariant components of an acceleration (at, ar, a\[Theta], \
a\[Phi]) a mass ratio given by \[Eta].\"\>", "InformationUsageText",
